  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen r&#xF6;rde upphandlingen av en konsult som skulle ta fram utbildningsmoduler. Konsulten hoppade dock av i sista stund och teamet besl&#xF6;t ist&#xE4;llet anv&#xE4;nda medlen f&#xF6;r metodutveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerned procurement of a consultant who would develop training modules on gender equality for Sida. But when the consultant turned down the assignment just before the contract would be signed the team decided to use the allocated funds for method development instead.</narrative>
